Some government work is easy to spot: a policeman directing traffic, a government school, a passport office. Some is hidden. Governments test medicines, check that food is safe, forecast the weather and decide what time it is officially.

Governments also run huge services. [[@indian-railways|Indian Railways]] carries crores of passengers every day and is owned by the government. The [[@mid-day-meal|mid-day meal]] scheme serves a hot lunch to more than ten crore schoolchildren in government schools.

